hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2168","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin apne deen mein kushaadgi mein rahega jab tak wo haraam khoon na bahaaye. (Bukhari: 6862)"
"2169","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Miqdaad se farmaya: Jab momin aadmi ho jo apna imaan kaafir qaum key sath chhupata ho aur wo apna imaan zaahir karey aur tum use qatl karo. To aise hi tum apna imaan Makkah mein us se pehley chhupatey they. (Bukhari: 6865)"
"2170","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ham par hathiyaar uthaaye wo ham mein se nahi hai. (Bukhari: 7070)"
"2171","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman aadmi ka khoon jo gawahi deta ho ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun halaal nahi hai magar teen mein se aik key sath: Jaan key badley jaan. Aur shaadi shuda zaani. Aur deen se nikalney wala jamaat chhorney wala. (Bukhari: 6878)"
"2172","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein Allah ko naapasandeeda teen hain: Haram mein ilhaad karney wala. Aur Islam mein jaahiliyat ki sunnat talab karney wala. Aur aadmi key khoon ka naahaq taalib taake uska khoon bahaaye. (Bukhari: 6882)"
"2173","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Agar tumhaarey ghar mein koi jhaankay aur tum ne use ijazat na di ho aur tum use kankari maaro aur uski aankh phod do to tum par gunaah nahi hai. (Bukhari: 6888)"
"2174","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ye aur ye baraabar hain. Yaani chhoti ungli aur angootha. (Bukhari: 6896). Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Be-zabaan ka zakhm zaaya hai. Aur kuwein (mein girna) zaaya hai. Aur khadaan zaaya hai. Aur dafan khazaanay mein paanchwaan hai. (6913). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Murtadon se tauba karaane ki kitaab."
